# The safe first task for a real Microduck. Nothing in its allowlist moves a leg, so it is
# what to point at a physical duck before you ever let it walk. It stands still, looks around
# with its head, and says what it can see.
---
duck: 1
name: microduck-lookout
description: Stand still, look around with the head only, and say what you can see.
author: rok
robots: microduck:sim2d
requires: [report_state, say]
verbs:
  allow: [gaze, observe, say, quack, report_state, stop]
  confirm: []
